# One command per line. scripts/check.sh runs them in order and fails if any fails.
# The tech-lead maintains this file (/team-init fills it). Developers cannot edit it.
# Must include a line that runs tests/acceptance explicitly, plus lint, typecheck, unit tests,
# and an import-boundary check when the stack has one (dependency-cruiser, import-linter, packwerk...).
#
# Examples:
#   npm run lint
#   npx tsc --noEmit
#   npx vitest run tests/unit
#   npx vitest run tests/acceptance
